{"version":1,"content":"<p>前女子組合Freeze成員陳樂榣（Ally）雙喜臨門，其第3及4間珠寶店今日（25號）同日開張，除前天堂鳥成員老公葉泓聲（Gordon）出席外，還有好友連詩雅（Shiga）及楊梓菁撐場，並齊主持剪綵儀式，場面熱鬧。</p><p>Ally讚Shiga腳頭好</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:43:58.006443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:37:17.064494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:37:17.064494+00:00","content_hash":"c1c0ea7b4d84e2d8cae1b283ae7e8d6e2b9724cf98b39e730750d16d2aea4a26","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}